WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.660 --> 01:47.030
=Episode 14=

01:52.630 --> 01:53.750
Someone is following us.

01:57.390 --> 01:59.990
Jinzhao, what do you think
the relationship between the person

02:00.070 --> 02:01.640
behind Mrs. Shi and Mr. Lin is?

02:02.230 --> 02:04.430
Catch that person, and we'll know.

02:05.400 --> 02:06.400
Everyone, relax.

02:06.670 --> 02:08.590
Shifang and Miss Ming will assist us.

02:11.400 --> 02:12.280
It's right ahead.

02:12.590 --> 02:13.070
Let's go.

02:25.800 --> 02:28.680
Miss Ming, Jinzhao
and the others have already gone in.

02:28.870 --> 02:30.840
Why haven't the people
of the Qiyuan Sect arrived yet?

02:32.640 --> 02:33.160
No hurry.

02:40.840 --> 02:41.640
Here they come.

03:03.230 --> 03:06.640
He carries the same scale
as Miss Shuo Xuan.

03:13.760 --> 03:14.910
He is Lin Yuan.

03:18.760 --> 03:19.680
Something's fishy.

03:31.510 --> 03:32.960
This is the place marked on the map.

03:33.760 --> 03:35.400
Since they've lured us here,

03:35.590 --> 03:37.000
why don't they show up and kill us?

03:37.590 --> 03:39.079
As expected,
these are the Dragon Crystals.

03:45.640 --> 03:46.720
Have they changed their plan?

04:29.720 --> 04:30.360
Interesting.

04:31.110 --> 04:33.000
Now, I can't feel the one
who was following us.

04:33.360 --> 04:35.520
But Lin Yuan has appeared.

04:46.030 --> 04:48.440
Mr. Lin, how come you're here?

04:48.550 --> 04:49.310
Why are you here?

04:49.800 --> 04:50.520
What a coincidence.

04:50.880 --> 04:52.030
I saw you all entering the mine.

04:52.190 --> 04:53.520
I was worried about your safety,

04:53.800 --> 04:54.640
so I followed to check.

04:55.000 --> 04:56.670
As long as you're safe, that's good.

04:59.950 --> 05:01.910
Yue, Qi,

05:03.110 --> 05:05.670
what's this for?

05:05.750 --> 05:08.280
Mr. Lin, we already know you're a demon.

05:08.950 --> 05:12.030
Mr. Lin, did you
know about our past all along

05:12.160 --> 05:13.310
and have been deceiving us?

05:13.800 --> 05:15.030
There are some misunderstandings.

05:15.160 --> 05:16.080
Let's take this outside.

05:17.110 --> 05:19.880
Mr. Lin, please tell us the truth.

05:20.030 --> 05:21.600
Enough talk. Just take him down.

05:36.830 --> 05:37.240
Qi.

05:47.159 --> 05:47.720
Oh, no.

06:09.230 --> 06:11.390
They're still inside.

06:12.000 --> 06:13.790
Miss Ming, could you please
think of something?

06:24.950 --> 06:25.630
Qi!

06:47.200 --> 06:48.760
Jinzhao, are you alright?

06:50.230 --> 06:50.880
Yes.

06:51.440 --> 06:52.280
Crawl out slowly.

07:14.630 --> 07:15.280
Jinzhao!

07:19.040 --> 07:19.550
Jinzhao.

07:20.720 --> 07:21.320
Jinzhao?

07:22.830 --> 07:23.950
Jinzhao, are you alright?

07:48.920 --> 07:49.920
Are you injured?

07:52.159 --> 07:53.830
Xian Qing, I'm fine.

07:54.320 --> 07:55.670
How about you? Are you hurt?

07:57.320 --> 07:58.320
I can feel that you are hurt.

07:59.630 --> 08:00.510
I'm really fine.

08:02.670 --> 08:03.280
Don't rush.

08:04.160 --> 08:05.280
I'll remove these rocks now

08:05.550 --> 08:06.200
to get you out.

08:06.440 --> 08:06.920
Wait.

08:08.390 --> 08:09.550
There was a collapse just now.

08:09.830 --> 08:11.000
If we use force to remove them,

08:11.110 --> 08:12.110
there might be another one.

08:12.440 --> 08:14.630
It won't be good
if it endangers Yue and Miss Yue.

08:15.720 --> 08:18.230
It's your nature
to always consider others first

08:18.720 --> 08:20.000
that worries me the most.

08:35.919 --> 08:39.880
Jinzhao, wake up.

08:59.920 --> 09:00.510
Wake up.

09:08.920 --> 09:09.510
Jinzhao,

09:10.350 --> 09:12.350
I thought you were dead.

09:18.200 --> 09:18.830
Jinzhao!

09:21.320 --> 09:22.760
Why are you coughing blood?

09:24.670 --> 09:27.440
Just because I was pinned by a stone.

09:28.230 --> 09:29.440
I will be better soon.

09:33.920 --> 09:35.920
Jinzhao, hang in there.

09:36.070 --> 09:37.830
I will definitely get you out of here.

09:37.950 --> 09:41.390
Silly, I'm not dead.

09:42.480 --> 09:43.440
What are you crying for?

09:53.630 --> 09:54.600
I'll help you up.

10:04.550 --> 10:05.230
Qi.

10:07.000 --> 10:07.950
Do you remember?

10:09.480 --> 10:10.110
What?

10:13.790 --> 10:15.920
After we woke up in the Wuyan Village,

10:16.950 --> 10:19.160
I came to the same mine

10:21.240 --> 10:23.070
to earn travel expenses.

10:23.680 --> 10:24.800
There was a collapse too.

10:25.870 --> 10:27.390
I was trapped for seven days and nights.

10:27.400 --> 10:30.340
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

10:31.520 --> 10:34.180
♪Let go of all regrets♪

10:34.180 --> 10:39.590
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

10:41.060 --> 10:44.610
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

10:45.160 --> 10:49.440
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

10:50.400 --> 10:53.960
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

10:54.950 --> 10:57.160
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

10:57.160 --> 11:00.200
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

11:00.200 --> 11:02.280
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

11:02.280 --> 11:06.340
♪I have no regrets♪

11:06.850 --> 11:11.620
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

11:11.620 --> 11:15.910
♪I pray for a miracle♪

11:15.910 --> 11:17.320
♪Over the time♪

11:17.720 --> 11:18.510
Jinzhao!

11:19.240 --> 11:22.080
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

11:22.080 --> 11:25.350
♪Of being with you forever♪

11:25.350 --> 11:30.050
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

11:30.760 --> 11:38.400
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

11:39.310 --> 11:40.310
How could you come here?

11:46.510 --> 11:47.480
What if something happens

11:47.920 --> 11:49.040
to you on the way here?

11:50.830 --> 11:51.430
Jinzhao.

11:52.510 --> 11:53.190
Say sorry.

11:53.830 --> 11:55.870
♪Memories are flying by♪

11:55.870 --> 11:56.830
Sorry.

11:56.830 --> 12:01.520
♪I'll follow you,
whether it's right or wrong♪

12:01.520 --> 12:06.540
♪Because you are
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

12:06.540 --> 12:10.380
♪I pray for a miracle♪

12:10.560 --> 12:12.360
- Why are you holding...
- Don't talk.

12:14.080 --> 12:16.930
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

12:16.930 --> 12:20.190
♪Of being with you forever♪

12:20.190 --> 12:24.900
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

12:25.600 --> 12:31.150
♪I will protect you in my life.
That's my love for you♪

12:37.510 --> 12:39.430
Don't worry. I am here.

12:39.800 --> 12:41.120
I won't let anything happen to you.

12:42.120 --> 12:43.160
I know.

12:44.510 --> 12:45.750
When we woke up,

12:45.870 --> 12:47.160
you already saved me once.

12:49.160 --> 12:50.510
But now I am thinking

12:51.950 --> 12:52.720
thank goodness

12:54.600 --> 12:55.560
you didn't leave me.

12:57.310 --> 12:58.120
And thank goodness

13:00.310 --> 13:02.190
we've always been by each other's side.

13:08.070 --> 13:08.750
Qi,

13:09.800 --> 13:10.630
who am I

13:12.750 --> 13:13.680
to you?

13:21.160 --> 13:21.830
Qi.

13:38.950 --> 13:40.480
Jinzhao, let's go.

13:41.160 --> 13:41.750
Let's go.

13:52.070 --> 13:52.920
- Zhaoyan.
- Xian Qing.

13:56.870 --> 13:57.560
I am here.

13:59.560 --> 14:00.240
I am here too.

14:10.800 --> 14:12.470
- Qi, Jinzhao.
- Zhaoyan.

14:12.470 --> 14:13.920
- How are you two?
- Where is Senior Xian Qing?

14:16.120 --> 14:18.160
Zhaoyan, Jinzhao seems injured.

14:18.280 --> 14:20.040
Do you have a way to move these stones?

14:26.480 --> 14:27.240
Dou Bao!

14:28.600 --> 14:29.480
Jinzhao, Little Yue.

14:29.870 --> 14:30.990
Ming Xiu, Shifang.

14:36.750 --> 14:37.240
Dou Bao.

14:43.120 --> 14:43.950
- Let's go.
- Go.

14:44.160 --> 14:44.950
- Hurry up.
- Hurry up.

14:45.680 --> 14:46.240
Hurry up.

14:48.680 --> 14:49.190
That was close.

14:50.720 --> 14:51.950
This time, credit goes to Dou Bao.

15:02.120 --> 15:04.310
This is my master's medicine.
It works faster.

15:04.750 --> 15:05.430
Thanks.

15:21.280 --> 15:22.480
Are you injured?

15:23.190 --> 15:23.950
It's not serious.

15:25.720 --> 15:27.510
Thank you for saving me just now.

15:28.480 --> 15:29.830
Zhao Yan, you're too polite with me.

15:31.430 --> 15:32.120
No.

15:34.310 --> 15:35.070
How are you?

15:35.800 --> 15:37.600
I'm fine, Miss Ming. Thank you.

15:43.920 --> 15:44.600
How are you now?

15:46.920 --> 15:47.480
Better.

15:50.160 --> 15:50.920
Jinzhao.

15:53.950 --> 15:54.830
I'll answer

15:55.190 --> 15:56.950
your question

15:57.120 --> 15:57.950
when it's only us.

16:16.430 --> 16:18.390
I didn't expect this visit
to the Wuyan Village

16:18.630 --> 16:19.720
would not only yield nothing

16:20.390 --> 16:22.280
but almost cost us our lives.

16:22.510 --> 16:23.920
But it's not true that we got nothing.

16:31.560 --> 16:32.280
Mr. Lin.

16:35.160 --> 16:35.720
Lin Yuan.

16:39.280 --> 16:39.800
Come on.

16:39.920 --> 16:41.560
How could you have
someone attack them like that?

16:42.280 --> 16:44.870
Commander Ge, I had
no intention of taking their lives.

16:45.430 --> 16:47.600
I just wanted to trap them in the cave

16:47.870 --> 16:50.040
to buy time to transport
the last batch of the Dragon Crystals.

16:50.510 --> 16:53.750
But General Lin Yuan suddenly appeared.

16:54.160 --> 16:56.190
He must have followed us here.

16:56.360 --> 16:59.510
The Sea of Clear Skies must have known
we are collecting the Dragon Crystals

16:59.920 --> 17:01.990
and will intensify
the vigilance against us.

17:04.310 --> 17:05.630
It's my failure.

17:06.920 --> 17:07.869
I must return immediately

17:08.119 --> 17:09.599
to report this matter
to my eldest brother.

17:10.430 --> 17:12.240
Now that the Dragon Crystals
have been fully collected,

17:12.630 --> 17:15.190
you can withdraw
to the Yujie Hub immediately.

17:16.280 --> 17:16.750
Yes.

17:17.990 --> 17:18.560
Alright.

17:19.190 --> 17:20.119
Help me pack it.

17:34.280 --> 17:35.160
Mr. Lin.

17:35.630 --> 17:36.630
Where am I?

17:39.560 --> 17:40.510
Just confess.

17:42.040 --> 17:43.160
What should I confess?

17:44.040 --> 17:45.510
It's killing me with pain.

17:47.360 --> 17:48.750
What's your relationship with Shuo Xuan?

17:53.280 --> 17:54.480
What are you talking about?

17:55.360 --> 17:57.920
I have no idea what you mean.

17:59.070 --> 18:00.190
Who is Shuo Xuan?

18:16.630 --> 18:17.360
You demon.

18:18.240 --> 18:19.070
You aren't gonna tell us?

18:21.160 --> 18:22.480
It seems I can't hide it anymore.

18:27.870 --> 18:28.510
Young lord,

18:29.680 --> 18:31.240
please forgive my earlier rudeness.

18:33.480 --> 18:34.240
Me?

18:36.040 --> 18:38.990
Qi is actually the young lord
of our Yu Clan.

18:39.560 --> 18:40.280
Yu?

18:40.720 --> 18:41.240
What?

18:41.430 --> 18:42.630
The Y-Yu Clan?

18:43.240 --> 18:45.920
We are sea demons
living in the Sea of Clear Skies.

18:46.390 --> 18:48.800
Miss Yue is a demon?

18:49.590 --> 18:51.920
But Little Yue has no demonic aura.

18:53.710 --> 18:55.110
Her Lordship of Yu Clan, Zhu Yu,

18:55.230 --> 18:56.440
is a mythical beast

18:56.920 --> 18:58.230
that has existed since ancient times.

18:58.350 --> 18:59.800
You can't compare him
to any other demons.

19:03.320 --> 19:05.230
You say Qi is your Lordship's child.

19:05.630 --> 19:08.510
Why did you abandon her
in the Mortal Realm,

19:08.710 --> 19:11.080
completely ignoring her for three years?

19:14.470 --> 19:15.870
This is Her Lordship's punishment
for you,

19:16.200 --> 19:17.630
so you ended up being a mortal

19:17.920 --> 19:19.590
stranded in the Mortal Realm.

19:20.650 --> 19:21.840
Punishment?

19:22.470 --> 19:25.680
D-Did Little Yue do anything wrong?

19:27.080 --> 19:29.390
We have a forbidden technique

19:29.510 --> 19:30.840
called the Husheng Spell.

19:31.470 --> 19:32.990
If it's cast on someone,

19:35.350 --> 19:37.200
that person will lose the memory

19:37.320 --> 19:40.040
and the previous personality
will be erased.

19:40.470 --> 19:41.160
From then on,

19:42.320 --> 19:44.330
this person must live for the one
who used the technique

19:44.510 --> 19:45.280
and protect that one

19:46.750 --> 19:48.200
their whole life.

19:50.280 --> 19:53.510
Losing the personality and memory,

19:54.750 --> 19:58.470
and living only
for another person from then on.

19:58.750 --> 20:00.800
Yes, three years ago, our young lord

20:00.870 --> 20:02.160
traveled in the Mortal Realm.

20:02.440 --> 20:03.630
When passing by Wuyan Village,

20:03.920 --> 20:05.110
she unintentionally used

20:05.200 --> 20:07.200
the Husheng Spell on a young mortal.

20:08.320 --> 20:11.280
Once this spell is cast,
it can't be undone.

20:11.680 --> 20:13.350
Her Lordship loves you,

20:13.960 --> 20:16.840
but it was such a grave mistake,
so you can't go unpunished.

20:17.160 --> 20:18.960
Thus, Her Lordship erased your memory,

20:19.080 --> 20:20.350
turning you into a whole new person

20:20.680 --> 20:22.510
to better reflect on yourself
in the Mortal Realm.

20:25.200 --> 20:28.920
Could that mortal youth be Yue?

20:29.560 --> 20:30.470
Over these three years,

20:30.590 --> 20:32.960
we've also been asking around
everywhere for Yue's origins.

20:33.230 --> 20:35.470
But your background is very mysterious.

20:35.560 --> 20:36.920
It's still unknown to this day.

20:37.590 --> 20:38.680
In that case,

20:38.990 --> 20:41.280
we could only leave our young lord
and you in this village.

20:41.510 --> 20:42.710
Her Lordship worries about you,

20:43.390 --> 20:45.320
so he asked me and Shuo Xuan
to protect you in secret.

20:46.680 --> 20:48.280
Then have you found one

20:48.510 --> 20:50.560
who looks exactly like Jinzhao?

21:01.960 --> 21:02.630
Jinzhao.

21:13.200 --> 21:14.390
I will go to the Sea of Clear Skies.

21:20.590 --> 21:21.110
Well, okay.

21:22.320 --> 21:24.630
Her Lordship misses you a lot.

21:26.280 --> 21:26.870
I'll go too.

21:27.710 --> 21:28.510
Then let's go together.

21:29.630 --> 21:32.040
Are you all going
to the Demon Realm with the demon?

21:34.350 --> 21:35.280
We are friends first.

21:36.110 --> 21:38.470
The mortal and demon thing comes second.

21:40.350 --> 21:40.990
Xiu.

21:45.920 --> 21:48.040
Hanjiang usually can't bear
to scold Xiu.

21:48.920 --> 21:51.960
If he knew Xiu had
no concern for companions,

21:52.350 --> 21:53.800
it would be me who got rebuked.

22:35.390 --> 22:36.440
You're annoying!

22:37.800 --> 22:38.440
No, I'm not.

23:07.200 --> 23:08.350
You finally smiled.

23:10.730 --> 23:11.630
I'm not talking to you.

23:12.710 --> 23:13.680
You're doing it, aren't you?

23:17.350 --> 23:18.230
I know

23:19.080 --> 23:21.510
that your mother was killed by a demon.

23:21.840 --> 23:24.320
For years, you have been persistent
in eradicating demons.

23:24.440 --> 23:25.960
That's because I was young then.

23:26.110 --> 23:27.230
I couldn't protect her.

23:28.200 --> 23:31.990
But now, I absolutely will not allow
demons to do wrong before me.

23:32.590 --> 23:33.390
But, Xiu,

23:34.230 --> 23:35.680
you want to eradicate demons,

23:36.080 --> 23:38.280
but you always refuse
to understand them.

23:39.350 --> 23:43.160
Do you know that if you want to win,
you must know yourself and your enemy?

23:46.350 --> 23:46.960
Quibbling.

23:49.710 --> 23:50.800
Later in the Yu Clan's turf,

23:51.320 --> 23:52.800
you must restrain your temper.

23:53.510 --> 23:55.710
I know. I'm not an idiot.

23:58.080 --> 23:59.110
Aren't you?

23:59.470 --> 23:59.920
You!

24:18.110 --> 24:18.840
Jinzhao.

24:23.200 --> 24:24.470
If what Mr. Lin,

24:25.390 --> 24:28.160
no, what Lin Yuan said is true,

24:29.040 --> 24:29.920
then I am

24:30.040 --> 24:31.990
the reason you lost your memory.

24:33.080 --> 24:33.840
I'm sorry.

24:37.280 --> 24:39.510
Silly, haven't you also said

24:40.590 --> 24:43.160
that his words might not be true?

24:46.390 --> 24:47.040
Everyone, look!

24:47.280 --> 24:47.870
What is that?

24:58.220 --> 24:59.880
(Sea of Clear Skies,
Yu Clan's home on Kun's spine)

25:04.960 --> 25:06.990
Oh my, am I seeing this right?

25:07.800 --> 25:10.110
A city floats in the sky!

25:11.280 --> 25:11.920
You're right.

25:13.990 --> 25:15.350
That is the Sea of Clear Skies,

25:18.920 --> 25:20.320
our home.

25:20.840 --> 25:22.110
I'll go call Xian Qing and Miss Ming.

25:25.710 --> 25:28.710
Is this really my home?

25:42.630 --> 25:44.080
It seems a bit desolate.

25:45.510 --> 25:46.280
The Sea of Clear Skies

25:46.630 --> 25:48.350
was once the pearl of the sea.

25:48.680 --> 25:50.590
But over a decade ago,
it faced great disaster

25:51.510 --> 25:53.200
causing great harm to our clan.

25:53.560 --> 25:54.470
Up to now,

25:55.230 --> 25:56.840
we have all been recuperating.

25:58.630 --> 25:59.920
What kind of great disaster was it?

26:01.590 --> 26:03.920
Young lord, you will learn of it.

26:04.560 --> 26:05.200
Hello.

26:14.920 --> 26:15.590
Shifang,

26:16.160 --> 26:18.040
this is a ritual unique
to the women of our clan.

26:18.390 --> 26:19.990
But you're a man.

26:22.080 --> 26:24.800
Is Miss Shuo Xuan also here?

26:25.590 --> 26:28.110
I never knew you had
a romantic side, Mr. Ju.

26:29.560 --> 26:30.840
Shifang, so there's someone

26:30.960 --> 26:32.560
who you've got feelings for here.

26:33.840 --> 26:35.920
When we get to the great hall,

26:36.080 --> 26:37.560
you will meet Her Lordship.

26:38.470 --> 26:39.350
As well as Shuo Xuan.

26:39.840 --> 26:40.350
Please.

26:55.040 --> 26:56.560
This is the entrance.

26:56.750 --> 26:57.630
Everyone, follow me.

27:10.870 --> 27:12.200
Miss Shuo Xuan.

27:16.080 --> 27:16.840
It's been a while.

27:18.750 --> 27:19.320
Your Lordship.

27:24.210 --> 27:25.480
(Lord Zhu Yu of the Yu Clan)

27:33.190 --> 27:34.230
(General Lin Yuan of Yu Clan)

27:34.230 --> 27:37.160
This is Zhu Yu, the Lord of Yu Clan.

27:40.800 --> 27:42.110
What a familiar feeling.

27:45.110 --> 27:45.710
Qi.

28:03.160 --> 28:03.840
You

28:04.800 --> 28:06.470
are my mother?

28:33.800 --> 28:34.350
It hurts?

28:49.630 --> 28:50.840
Not anymore.

28:56.230 --> 28:58.920
Qi, you are growing.

28:59.870 --> 29:00.390
Young lord,

29:01.230 --> 29:03.990
the bloodline of Kun flows within you.

29:04.510 --> 29:05.630
Now scales have begun to appear.

29:06.230 --> 29:09.280
That indicates your
mythical beast's power has awakened.

29:09.920 --> 29:10.510
Kun.

29:11.230 --> 29:14.800
In the North Sea,
there is a fish by the name of Kun.

29:18.800 --> 29:20.320
Are you really Qi's biological mother?

29:27.560 --> 29:28.920
Qi is my own flesh and blood.

29:32.200 --> 29:32.960
Then, am I

29:34.840 --> 29:36.200
truly Qi's Husheng?

29:43.110 --> 29:43.840
Your Lordship,

29:44.630 --> 29:46.200
my bad for letting them know about

29:46.560 --> 29:48.680
the Husheng Spell
without your permission.

29:49.200 --> 29:52.560
I will personally explain this later
to the young lord and Yue.

29:55.350 --> 29:57.440
This matter concerns our secrets.

29:57.840 --> 29:59.680
Please come this way.

30:01.110 --> 30:01.560
Alright.

30:02.160 --> 30:04.990
Then we will take our leave.

30:06.390 --> 30:07.110
Shuo Xuan,

30:08.350 --> 30:09.750
take them to the guest rooms.

30:16.390 --> 30:16.960
Follow me.

30:23.870 --> 30:24.920
I don't believe what you said.

30:26.350 --> 30:26.990
Any evidence?

30:31.510 --> 30:32.040
Yue,

30:33.750 --> 30:35.590
the resonance of your energy
with the young lord's

30:35.870 --> 30:36.990
is the best proof.

30:38.280 --> 30:42.630
And power resonance is mutual.

30:43.510 --> 30:44.960
Previously, our young lord was young

30:45.230 --> 30:46.320
and lacked sufficient power,

30:47.680 --> 30:49.920
so your power was activated

30:49.990 --> 30:50.920
to protect her.

30:56.920 --> 30:58.160
(- Mindlink
- Mindlink)

30:59.560 --> 31:01.840
(- arose from the Husheng Spell?
- arose from the Husheng Spell?)

31:21.350 --> 31:22.040
Young Lord!

31:25.920 --> 31:27.510
(Xi Luo, Zhu Yu's attendant)
Her Lordship knew you would return

31:27.800 --> 31:29.440
and specially prepared
a welcoming ceremony.

31:30.630 --> 31:31.960
You've been away for three years.

31:32.590 --> 31:35.110
Everyone is waiting to see you.

31:43.040 --> 31:43.680
Qi,

31:44.680 --> 31:46.800
it's a joyous thing to find your family.

31:47.680 --> 31:48.470
Stay with your mother.

32:16.910 --> 32:17.960
By Her Lordship's command,

32:17.960 --> 32:20.920
ensure the young lord is dressed up
before the welcoming ceremony.

32:25.990 --> 32:27.990
Why must I dress up like this?

32:28.710 --> 32:30.510
Because you are to attend
the welcoming ceremony.

32:32.590 --> 32:34.590
I don't want to attend any ceremony.

32:35.040 --> 32:36.110
I'm going to find Jinzhao.

32:38.230 --> 32:40.960
Are you referring to that young mortal?

32:43.280 --> 32:46.470
Do you want him
to be your future prince consort?

32:48.440 --> 32:49.110
Prince consort?

32:53.040 --> 32:53.840
Your prince consort

32:54.560 --> 32:56.350
will be forever with you.

32:56.630 --> 32:59.110
You will share happiness
and suffering together.

32:59.960 --> 33:01.990
I want Jinzhao to be my prince consort.

33:02.160 --> 33:03.800
I want to be with him forever.

33:04.590 --> 33:07.680
It's just that I don't know
if he wants to.

33:09.390 --> 33:11.960
To my knowledge,
nobody refuses to be a prince consort.

33:12.200 --> 33:12.710
Really?

33:14.960 --> 33:17.710
And it doesn't matter
even if he doesn't want to.

33:18.280 --> 33:19.320
In our territory,

33:20.160 --> 33:21.200
we will surely find

33:21.470 --> 33:23.680
a perfect prince consort for you.

33:24.920 --> 33:27.990
No need. I only want Jinzhao.

33:47.080 --> 33:49.590
Jinzhao.

34:01.320 --> 34:04.920
Jinzhao, would you like
to be my prince consort?

34:07.630 --> 34:09.590
Xi Luo says my prince consort

34:09.960 --> 34:11.989
can be with me forever

34:12.159 --> 34:14.590
and that we'd share happiness
and face hardships together.

34:15.080 --> 34:17.040
If you'd like to be my prince consort,

34:17.750 --> 34:19.870
we'll be together forever.

34:25.440 --> 34:27.389
Now we have money and status.

34:27.510 --> 34:29.989
We can have ten eggs
with a bowl of noodles.

34:33.679 --> 34:35.560
Jinzhao, what's wrong?

34:37.710 --> 34:39.590
Are you thinking about
the Husheng thing?

34:41.630 --> 34:44.040
It's alright.
I'll be your Husheng from now on.

34:44.159 --> 34:44.920
I will protect you.

34:56.630 --> 34:57.280
I just want

34:59.230 --> 35:01.280
to be with you as Yue Jinzhao.

35:07.680 --> 35:11.040
Are you blaming me

35:11.350 --> 35:12.840
for making you lose your memory?

35:14.230 --> 35:14.870
Of course not.

35:17.230 --> 35:18.390
Back in the mine,

35:19.510 --> 35:20.630
my only thought

35:22.200 --> 35:24.200
was to be with you forever.

35:25.080 --> 35:25.470
But...

35:28.750 --> 35:30.680
Now I'm no longer certain.

35:31.710 --> 35:32.920
Not certain about what?

35:36.560 --> 35:37.510
Not certain

35:40.590 --> 35:42.560
whether my feelings for you are true

35:43.630 --> 35:46.560
or just the result of the Husheng Spell.

35:52.990 --> 35:56.230
We're like blossoms side by side,
connected but with separate roots.

35:57.910 --> 36:01.670
Are our feelings fake?

36:03.750 --> 36:04.800
They are of course real.

36:09.090 --> 36:12.640
♪Forming a bond
reminiscent of a rainbow♪

36:12.640 --> 36:13.400
I need a moment.

36:14.110 --> 36:20.240
♪Writing about your struggle♪

36:20.240 --> 36:26.570
♪Being irrational and silly
because of you♪

36:26.570 --> 36:32.660
♪Betting your whole life♪

36:33.600 --> 36:34.080
Your Lordship,

36:35.040 --> 36:37.670
the Qiyuan Sect's strongholds
were successively destroyed.

36:38.040 --> 36:39.360
I found it suspicious,

36:39.750 --> 36:42.560
so I followed Ge Qingfei
of the Hengdao Sect to Wuyan Village.

36:43.230 --> 36:46.230
But unexpectedly, my identity was exposed
by Yue Jinzhao and the others.

36:47.230 --> 36:49.400
To guard the truth,

36:49.750 --> 36:52.470
I had no choice but to falsely invent
a spell called Husheng.

36:53.230 --> 36:54.510
Please punish me, My Lord.

36:55.640 --> 36:58.360
It's alright. If not for this,

36:58.600 --> 37:00.400
I would not be able to see Qi again.

37:01.600 --> 37:04.990
It's just that she mustn't
know the truth yet.

37:05.040 --> 37:08.470
It might be too much for her.

37:30.180 --> 37:33.100
♪Looking back♪

37:34.220 --> 37:37.410
♪I try to bring back memories♪

37:38.310 --> 37:42.210
♪We're connected♪

37:42.210 --> 37:44.480
♪It's meant to be♪

37:46.080 --> 37:49.730
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

37:50.250 --> 37:54.060
♪Years leave no trace behind♪

37:54.060 --> 37:56.290
♪On a moonlight night♪

37:56.290 --> 37:58.280
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

37:58.280 --> 38:01.000
♪About you♪

38:01.000 --> 38:04.290
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

38:05.000 --> 38:08.390
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

38:08.940 --> 38:10.790
♪The past glided before my mind♪

38:10.790 --> 38:13.030
♪I smiled and cried♪

38:13.030 --> 38:18.280
♪For happiness♪

38:18.280 --> 38:22.180
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

38:22.180 --> 38:26.280
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

38:26.280 --> 38:28.230
♪In this tranquil world♪

38:28.230 --> 38:30.280
♪I've finally found you♪

38:30.280 --> 38:34.310
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

38:34.310 --> 38:38.050
♪I've been looking for you♪

38:38.050 --> 38:42.180
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

38:43.020 --> 38:44.450
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

38:44.450 --> 38:46.720
♪I engrave your name♪

38:46.720 --> 38:52.740
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

39:08.260 --> 39:11.270
♪Wind rises and rain ceases♪

39:12.230 --> 39:15.400
♪During the long-lost quiet time♪

39:16.230 --> 39:20.160
♪Both of us get closer♪

39:20.160 --> 39:22.310
♪And watch the stars♪

39:24.070 --> 39:27.240
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

39:28.200 --> 39:31.360
♪Stories leave no trace behind♪

39:31.360 --> 39:34.120
♪On a moonlight night♪

39:34.120 --> 39:36.260
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

39:36.260 --> 39:38.920
♪About you♪

39:38.920 --> 39:42.500
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

39:43.050 --> 39:44.450
♪It's unforgettable♪

39:44.450 --> 39:46.400
♪It's all about you♪

39:47.020 --> 39:49.280
♪The past glided before my mind♪

39:49.280 --> 39:50.980
♪I smiled and cried♪

39:50.980 --> 39:56.070
♪For happiness♪

39:56.070 --> 40:00.000
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

40:00.000 --> 40:04.000
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

40:04.000 --> 40:06.240
♪In this tranquil world♪

40:06.240 --> 40:08.230
♪I've finally found you♪

40:08.230 --> 40:12.260
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

40:12.260 --> 40:16.200
♪I've been looking for you♪

40:16.200 --> 40:20.420
♪I wish to share joy
